IMS Image Replication job: {
  shape: sequence_diagram

  ImsReplicationJob
  Runner
  Azure

  ImsReplicationJob -> ImsReplicationJob: Iterates through image definitions\nand image versions
  ImsReplicationJob -> Runner: Get VM usage for image definition id
  Runner."vms_count_per_version_and_region: {\n'1.0.0': { 'eastus': 10, 'westus': 20 },\n'2.0.0': { 'eastus': 50, 'westus': 300 }\n}"

  Runner -> ImsReplicationJob: Image usage

  ImsReplicationJob -> Azure: Set replication regions and replicas count for image version
}
